Subject: [PATCH 73/97] recoverssm: align: keep a boundary-ending state in its
 block (port of upstream #58863, 5567cc1b25)

Port of the upstream vLLM change #58863 (Apache-2.0). A window whose accepted tokens end exactly on a block boundary now commits into
the block it ends in, not the next, possibly unallocated, column.
